    "description": {
      "en-US": "LocalSend is an open source app to share files and messages between nearby devices using the local wifi network.\nThe communication between devices is entirely end-to-end encrypted via HTTPS.\nNo Internet required. No tracking*. No ads.\n\nCurrently, this app is available on Android, iOS, macOS, Windows and Linux. You can find all download options on the official homepage.\n\n*The operating system may still gather usage data.\n",
      "pt-BR": "LocalSend \u00e9 um app de c\u00f3digo aberto para compartilhar arquivos e mensagens entre dispositivos por perto usando a rede WiFi local.\nA comunica\u00e7\u00e3o entre dispositivos \u00e9 criptografada inteiramente via HTTPS.\nInternet n\u00e3o \u00e9 necess\u00e1rio. Sem rastreamento*. Sem an\u00fancios.\n\nAtualmente, este app est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel no Android, iOS, macOS, Windows e Linux. Voc\u00ea pode encontrar todas as op\u00e7\u00f5es de download na p\u00e1gina oficial.\n\n*O sistema operacional pode ainda coletar dados de utiliza\u00e7\u00e3o."
    },
